WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.300
得了吧，你连坐都坐不稳了。我送你回家。
Come on. You can barely sit up. I'll drive you home.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.350
不用。我好着呢。好得很。
No. I'm good. I'm so good.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:11.800
走吧。
Let's go.

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:19.520
哇……我接住你了。
Whoa. I got you.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:21.820
Rafa。
Rafa.

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:25.320
这是我男朋友。
This is my boyfriend.

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:28.230
什么时候的事？你们俩不是“只是朋友”吗。
Since when? You two are just friends.

00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:30.690
吻我。
Kiss me.

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:32.240
让他信以为真。
Make him believe it.

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:50.680
他走了。
He's gone.

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:52.730
嗯。
Yeah.

00:00:56.130 --> 00:00:59.730
好了。喝水。然后我送你回家。
Okay. Water. Then I'm taking you home.

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:09.720
醒了？
Awake?

00:01:10.110 --> 00:01:10.970
水在这里。
Water’s here.

00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:12.970
要是头疼，先别喝咖啡。
Leave the coffee if your head hurts.

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:14.920
昨晚那场临时男友任务，
Temporary boyfriend duty last night.

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:15.970
我觉得自己表现还不错。
I thought I did all right.

00:01:16.810 --> 00:01:18.810
不过，有件事得说清楚。
One thing needs clearing up, though.

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:21.770
替你挡住 Evan，是演的。
Keeping Evan off your back was an act.

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:24.470
想吻你，不是。
Wanting to kiss you wasn’t.

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:26.910
我喜欢你。
I like you.

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:29.520
有一阵子了。
Have for a while.

00:01:30.620 --> 00:01:32.970
昨晚不代表你答应过任何事。
Last night doesn’t mean you agreed to anything.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:35.660
你愿意和我约会吗？
Will you go on a date with me?

00:01:36.020 --> 00:01:36.910
一次真正的约会。
A real date.

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:40.120
不是因为刚好顺路，就一起吃顿饭。
Not just dinner because we happen to be heading the same way.

00:01:41.733 --> 00:01:44.033
她：我需要时间。先吃早餐，答案晚点给你。
Her: I need time. Breakfast first, and I'll give you my answer later.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 1 轮 · Realtime round 1）

00:01:44.133 --> 00:01:46.454
她：我需要时间。先吃早餐。
I need time. Breakfast first.

00:01:46.654 --> 00:01:48.975
好。你慢慢想。
Okay. Take all the time.

00:01:55.870 --> 00:01:59.017
先吃吧。这不是圈套。
Eat first. No trick.

00:01:59.317 --> 00:02:01.617
她：我想吃榴莲披萨
Her: I want durian pizza.
（实时生成 · 5+10 · 第 2 轮 · Realtime round 2）

00:02:01.717 --> 00:02:04.038
